# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check-generated-files
  stage web
  description "R1188-U8: every file whose header says it is generated by a command is checked against that generator by a registered CI gate or workflow step, unless data/meta/generated-files.lino lists it with the reason CI cannot run its generator."
  run "node scripts/check-generated-files.mjs"
  justification "PR #1188 (R1188-U8) asks that bulk changes be made by rules, not by hand; without this gate a generated file could be edited by hand and merged when no gate ran its --check."
